.TH fake_mldrouter6 8 2026-02-07 THC IPv6 ATTACK TOOLKIT
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.B fake_mldrouter6

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
fake_mldrouter6 [-l] interface advertise|solicitate|terminate [own-ip [own-mac-address]]

Announce, delete or soliciated MLD router - sourself or others.
Use -l to loop and send (in 5s intervals) until Control-C is pressed.
